<title>USA: Arvin Industries Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Arvin Industries Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ind. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.83		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net			 18,800		    7,400</p>
<p> Revs		     560,700		  500,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  22,690		   22,300</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.09		    $0.85</p>
<p> Net			 47,100		   19,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,212,700		1,966,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  22,516		   22,355</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 and 12-mos net and shr include $0.31/shr gain on one-time items, including $0.48/shr gain on sale of investment in an Argentine ride control producer and a reduction in earnings of $0.17/shr on acceleration of certain profit-improvement projects. Excluding these items, 1996 Q4 shr was $0.52 and 1996 shr was $1.78.</p>
<p>1995 12-mos net includes earnings from discontinued operations of $0.05/shr.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
